  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/09/IMG_20190913_210516.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p>S&#39;ha fet la vesprada-nit d&#39;aquest divendres a la Casa de la Cultura, en un acte condu&iuml;t pel periodista taur&iacute; Jorge Casals i amb la intervenci&oacute; de Germ&aacute;n Vidal, de Cabanes, ramader que torna amb els seus animals &#39;de corro&#39;. L&#39;alcaldessa, Carmina Ballester FEliu, ha tancat la presentaci&oacute;, en una sala plena de gom a gom, en la qual tamb&eacute; estaven la que ser&agrave; reina de la Fira 2019, Simi Slatinsk&aacute;, i la seua dama, Elisabeth Brun L&oacute;pez.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0383.jpg\" alt=\"img_0383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0386.jpg\" alt=\"img_0386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0389.jpg\" alt=\"img_0389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0392.jpg\" alt=\"img_0392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0396.jpg\" alt=\"img_0396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0397.jpg\" alt=\"img_0397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0399.jpg\" alt=\"img_0399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencartellbousfira19/img_0403.jpg\" alt=